    {
      "beat_id": "NB06",
      "act": "3 mechanism",
      "narration_text": "Stage three hands the finished sections to a fresh Claude — no memory of this conversation. It reads cold and asks what a real reader would ask. In Claude Code that runs automatically, as a sub-agent; elsewhere, you open a new chat and do it yourself.",
