      "beat_id": "NB07",
      "act": "4 ANCHOR PAYOFF",
      "narration_text": "Back to that payments spec: the fresh Claude stops cold at \"the settlement window\" — it has no idea what that means, because nobody ever defined it. That's the blind spot you couldn't see, caught by someone who wasn't in the room.",
