    {
      "beat_id": "NB09",
      "act": "5 DIRECTION B",
      "narration_text": "It doesn't fix everything. This is a long workflow, built for documents that get reviewed at scale — not a five-minute update. And if you patch the doc yourself without saying so, the next refine step is working from a draft that's already gone stale.",
